  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mauritius Multi-Sector Development Programme (MMDP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A multi-sector portfolio of flexible, small projects designed to be catalytic and to support the Government of Mauritius&apos; implementation of its Vision 20230 development strategy, and advancing HMG global development priorities including on climate change, women and youth empowerment, and illicit financial flows. This small investment has the potential to be a discrete programme or as a foundation on which to build a more ambitious long term bilateral package.</narrative>
  </description>
